   {
    "claim": "On 023b7fcc, with cars 0.5 s earlier at recorded speed, every kept run failed. In each, the policy steered left across the lane line against the command and side-swiped vehicle 56 in the next lane. Triage put this on the policy, and no run was flagged as an artifact.",
