   {
    "claim": "On 096988dd, cars 0.5 s earlier at 2x speed made every run fail, while 1.5x at the same timing passed. These failures are front hits on a slowing lead car (vehicle 9) that the camera showed as a see-through smear. Triage marked them as rendering, with the policy's fault unclear, so this case may be the simulator's rather than the policy's.",
